WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
We have a good reason why we actually need them, so that's why we're asking you to get

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.920
out of the street.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.840
Is it illegal for us to get out of the street?

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:11.520
They could arrest you, but we're asking you guys voluntarily, let's just get on the sidewalks

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:16.040
because if a car comes through and hits somebody, it's a better way for the government to deal

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.040
with it.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:22.160
Antifa is spitting on officers, and Bob is coaching them on how not to get arrested.

